1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,500
YOU PRESS THE HORN.

2
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:03,000
NOTHING HAPPENS.

3
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:05,500
USUALLY ONE OF THREE THINGS:

4
00:00:05,500 --> 00:00:08,000
A FUSE, A RELAY, OR A CLOCKSPRING.

5
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:10,500
THE CLOCKSPRING IS THE COILED RIBBON

6
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:13,000
BEHIND YOUR STEERING WHEEL.

7
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:15,000
YEARS OF TURNING WEAR IT OUT.

8
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:17,000
THEN THE HORN JUST GOES QUIET.

9
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:18,500
CHECK THE CHEAP PARTS FIRST.

10
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:20,000
STILL SILENT? WE'LL TRACE IT.
